{#- B-3 action plan as readable text. Arguments are slot placeholders, lists
    of them, or wording chosen by code (a category's name). The action itself
    is always the finding's own recommended_action, carried verbatim. -#}

{% macro heading() -%}
Actions, most urgent at the top:
{%- endmacro %}

{% macro action(category, severity, text, checkpoints, findings) -%}
{{ category }}, severity {{ severity }}: {{ text }} Checkpoints: {{ checkpoints | join(", ") }}. Findings: {{ findings | join(", ") }}.
{%- endmacro %}

{% macro unmapped(feature, checkpoints) -%}
No action is configured for finding type {{ feature }}. Findings of this type were recorded at {{ checkpoints | join(", ") }} and require manual review.
{%- endmacro %}

{% macro no_recorded_action(feature, checkpoints) -%}
No recommended action is recorded for finding type {{ feature }} at {{ checkpoints | join(", ") }}; manual review is required.
{%- endmacro %}

{% macro no_findings(run) -%}
No findings were recorded on run {{ run }}; the action plan is empty.
{%- endmacro %}
